<section class="inner-hero"><div class="container"><p class="section-kicker">INFORMATION / PRIVACY</p><h1>Privacy matters.<br /><em>Always.</em></h1><p>CareerCraft Studio is being prepared for secure online orders and document handling.</p></div></section>
<section class="section container legal-copy"><h2>Current website status</h2><p>This is a Phase 1 website preview. It does not offer customer accounts, upload facilities, checkout, or an order tracking system. No CV should be uploaded through this website.</p><h2>Enquiries</h2><p>The request form creates a prefilled email on your own device using your email application. It does not transmit the form to our website or save it in a database. If you choose to send the email, your email provider and the recipient will process its contents. Avoid including sensitive personal information in your initial message.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>The pages may load fonts hosted by Google. When hosted, standard infrastructure logs may be processed by the website hosting provider. The project does not currently use analytics, marketing cookies or payment scripts.</p><h2>Coming later</h2><p>Prior to any real document collection or checkout launch, this page will be replaced with a complete business privacy notice explaining purposes, lawful bases, recipients, retention periods, access controls and contact details, alongside appropriate legal terms.</p><p>This is a launch-status notice, not a claim that a future paid service has completed all regulatory checks.</p><a class="button button-dark" asp-action="Index">Back to home ↗</a></section>
